      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for making this post.\n\nI really don't want to pay for a digital consumeable, especially for as long as I've been on VRC+.\n\nI don't mind if it was free,  but paid is permanently owned.\n\nLike that's a good idea.  Give free 5 uses to VRC+ users as a sample.  People can see it,  try it,  and then think it's cool so they'll buy it. \n\nWe use this method all the time in the culinary business.  Samples sell!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
