      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While I have no issue with the items, stickers, and other cosmetics being paid this is just bad. I thought the item was cool at first but to make this a limited time consumable that costs $1 a use is just bad. If I pay for something digital in VRChat I should be able to keep it, this isn't some gacha game or something where I'm purchasing consumable boosts. I will speak with my money and not buy this or support any of these predatory purchases and hope VRChat walks this back.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
