      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's no way to vote against a canny, but I'd just like to speak out in support of consumables. I think the scarcity adds a special element of fun not present in the other items. I hope the dev team continues to create unique ideas like this that don't fit into people's perceptions of what items should be.\n\nThere's a huge difference in emotion between someone dropping an unlimited effect, vs. dropping a limited one. VRC+ giftings have been really entertaining. Even if you're not the one to receive it, it's exciting.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
