      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The fact that you've implemented this nonsense, while taking important developer/engine tools away and imposed more and more restrictions on avatar features, along with cutting avatar upload sizes *in half* makes my blood boil. What is 9.99 a month *really* getting us at this point?  You continue to take away more user control from us in this *User Generated Content based game* compared to what we had over a year ago. This gimmick section is completely within your control to limit and monetize how you see fit, while you continue to strip things away to sell back to us piecemeal, but how long do you think you can do that before people can't take any more? How long do you think it'll take before too many people say \"why are we paying for content that means nothing, and is so fleeting?\" Do better for your community, especially your PC VR based community.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
