      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here to observe the collective heartbreak of global society witnessing its glorious future of abundance being clawed back by the pedagogy of the old world's guild-city kings.\n\nSurvivor species within an ecosystem naturally navigate around scarcity and settle in niches of abundance. VRChat in the past taught me so much about how gift economies are not just possible but *necessary* for survival. I am sorry that we could not get them to understand this lesson sooner. I'm thankful to have experienced a small glimpse of that potential here for a time. \n\nCampfires (especially virtual ones) should be always abundant for those that need them!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
