  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-12-09T06:47:30.124Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I deeply disagree with and find the new \"Portable Winterizer\" to be predatory and hostile in how it is temporary both in time and being a consumable costing rounded 5 USD. \n\nWhile I understand VRChat needs to be profitable, it needs to be done in respect to the community and userbase, and IF consumables exist it needs to be much more carefully thought through than something this hostile.\n\nFor example Recroom has roleplay food consumables designed to be shared and be social to further engage in its mechanics. Its prices are reasonable and MOST IMPORTANTLY the ingame currency can be obtained via in game interactions.\n\nThis item while can be holiday fomo even if i disagree with that it, NEEDS to be permanent and this needs to be learned from for any future possible consumables.\n\nThank you.",
